---
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
import "../style/pages/legal.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | ToolVector"
  description="Read the Terms of Service for ToolVector. These terms govern your use of our software review and comparison platform."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-page__hero">
      <div class="container legal-page__hero-inner">
        <div class="legal-page__badge">Legal</div>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-page__meta">
          Last updated: <time datetime="2026-07-30">July 30, 2026</time>
        </p>
        <p class="legal-page__lead">
          By accessing or using toolvector.io ("ToolVector," "we," "us," "the
          site"), you agree to comply with these Terms of Service.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container legal-page__body">
      <aside class="legal-toc">
        <p class="legal-toc__label">On this page</p>
        <nav>
          <a href="#acceptance">1. Acceptance of Terms</a>
          <a href="#description">2. Description of Service</a>
          <a href="#eligibility">3. Eligibility &amp; Use</a>
          <a href="#content-reviews">4. Content &amp; Reviews</a>
          <a href="#affiliate-links">5. Affiliate Links &amp; Ads</a>
          <a href="#submissions">6. Product Submissions</a>
          <a href="#prohibited-conduct">7. Prohibited Conduct</a>
          <a href="#intellectual-property">8. Intellectual Property</a>
          <a href="#limitation-liability">9. Limitation of Liability</a>
          <a href="#termination">10. Termination</a>
          <a href="#changes">11. Changes to These Terms</a>
          <a href="#governing-law">12. Governing Law</a>
          <a href="#contact">13. Contact Us</a>
        </nav>
      </aside>

      <article class="legal-content">
        <div class="legal-notice">
          <span class="legal-notice__icon">⚠️</span>
          <p>
            This is a suggested draft/outline based on the features currently
            visible on the site. This is <strong>not legal advice</strong>. Have
            a lawyer review it before publishing, especially the liability
            limitation and affiliate clauses.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section id="acceptance">
          <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using toolvector.io ("ToolVector," "we," "us," "the
            site"), you agree to comply with these Terms of Service. If you do
            not agree, please discontinue use of the site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="description">
          <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
          <p>
            ToolVector is a platform that provides information, reviews, and
            comparisons of B2B software to help users find the right tools,
            including but not limited to:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Review articles, rankings, and product comparisons</li>
            <li>
              The <strong>Smart Match</strong> tool, which recommends software based
              on user needs
            </li>
            <li>A newsletter with updates on tools and deals</li>
            <li>A submission page for software vendors ("List your tool")</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="eligibility">
          <h2>3. Eligibility &amp; Use</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              You must be at least 16 years old (or the legal age of majority in
              your jurisdiction) to use the service.
            </li>
            <li>
              You agree to provide accurate information when creating an
              account, subscribing to the newsletter, or submitting the "List
              your tool" form.
            </li>
            <li>
              You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your
              login credentials.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="content-reviews">
          <h2>4. Content &amp; Reviews</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Reviews, rankings, and comparisons on ToolVector are compiled
              based on research, hands-on experience, and/or publicly available
              information from software vendors. We make reasonable efforts to
              ensure accuracy but <strong>do not guarantee</strong> that information
              is complete, current, or error-free.
            </li>
            <li>
              Rankings and recommendations from Smart Match are for
              informational purposes only and do not constitute professional
              advice or a guarantee of product performance.
            </li>
            <li>
              Users should independently verify, trial, and evaluate any
              software before making a purchase or usage decision.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="affiliate-links">
          <h2>5. Affiliate Links &amp; Advertising</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              ToolVector may earn a commission when you click on links or
              purchase products/services featured on the site (see our <strong
                >Affiliate Disclosure</strong
              > for details).
            </li>
            <li>
              Earning a commission <strong>does not affect</strong> the objectivity
              of our reviews, though we may give greater visibility to certain products
              with which we have a partnership.
            </li>
            <li>
              We are not responsible for the quality, availability, or policies
              of any linked third-party products or services.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="submissions">
          <h2>6. Product Submissions ("List your tool")</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Software vendors who submit product information for listing on
              ToolVector represent that the information provided is accurate,
              lawful, and does not infringe the intellectual property rights of
              any third party.
            </li>
            <li>
              ToolVector has sole discretion to approve, reject, edit, or remove
              any submitted content without providing a reason.
            </li>
            <li>
              Submitting a product does not guarantee any particular ranking,
              visibility, or a positive review.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="prohibited-conduct">
          <h2>7. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
          <p>When using ToolVector, you agree not to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Use the site for any unlawful or fraudulent purpose</li>
            <li>
              Post false, defamatory, or intellectual-property-infringing
              content
            </li>
            <li>
              Attempt unauthorized access to our systems, other users' data, or
              the site's technical infrastructure
            </li>
            <li>
              Use bots or automated crawlers to scrape data at scale without
              permission
            </li>
            <li>
              Impersonate any person or provide false information when
              registering
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="intellectual-property">
          <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              All content on ToolVector (articles, logos, interface, source
              code, etc.) is owned by ToolVector or used under proper license,
              unless otherwise noted.
            </li>
            <li>
              You may not copy, redistribute, or use our content for commercial
              purposes without written consent.
            </li>
            <li>
              Trademarks and logos of the software products mentioned belong to
              their respective owners.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="limitation-liability">
          <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              ToolVector provides the service "as-is," without any guarantee
              that it will be continuously available, error-free, or suited to
              any particular purpose.
            </li>
            <li>
              To the fullest extent permitted by law, ToolVector shall not be
              liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential
              damages arising from the use of (or inability to use) the site,
              including purchasing decisions made based on information provided
              on the site.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="termination">
          <h2>10. Termination</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to the
            service, without prior notice, if we determine you have violated
            these Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="changes">
          <h2>11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. The "Last
            updated" date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent
            changes. Continued use of the site after changes take effect
            constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="governing-law">
          <h2>12. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms are governed by the laws of <strong
              >[country/region]</strong
            >, without regard to its conflict-of-law principles.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
          <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact
            us:
          </p>
          <div class="legal-contact-card">
            <a href="mailto:yen@toolvector.io">
              <span>📧</span> yen@toolvector.io
            </a>
            <a href="/contact/">
              <span>🌐</span> toolvector.io/contact
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="legal-footer-note">
          These Terms should be read together with our
          <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> and
          <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
